cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Compatibility of unate Boolean functions via coverage vectors"
abstract: >-
  Source code and data accompanying the article "Compatibility of unate
  Boolean functions via coverage vectors". The repository includes the Python
  implementation of the coverage algorithm, the generators of synthetic binary
  observations, the experimental runners, and the raw and processed result
  files required to reproduce the experiments.
